        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Mwami wakaaba mumaanza aakwe Jehoyakimu mwami wa-Juda azibelesyo zimwi zyaŋanda ya-Leza, elyo wakazileta kunyika ya-Sinara kuŋanda ya-leza wakwe, azibelesyo wakazileta mucilondwedo caŋanda ya-leza wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami wakalailila Asipenazi silutwe wabazibe bakwe kuti alete bamwi babana ba-Israyeli, basilunyungu lwabwami alwabapati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
