        {
          "text": "Lino aba balombe bone, Leza wakabapa luzibo amaanu aakumvwisya mabuku oonse abusongo boonse. Alimwi Daniele kezi kupandulula zilengano zyoonse aziloto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nicakamana ciindi mwami ncaakabikide kuti baletwe kulinguwe, silutwe wabazibe wakabaleta kuli-Nebukadinezara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami wakaambaula abo, nkabela akati kabo boonse teekwakajanwa naba omwe uuli mbuli Daniele, Hananiya, Misayeli, a-Azariya, Nkaambo kako bakaima kunembo lyamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mumakani oonse aaluzibo amaanu mwami ngaakabuzya kulimbabo, wakajana kuti balainda ziindi zili ikumi basondi abacape boonse bamucisi cakwe coonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
